        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Semente. Quanto mais luz solar Ivysaur recebe, mais força ele acumula, permitindo que o botão em suas costas cresça. O bulbo também aumenta à medida que absorve nutrientes e, quando floresce, libera um aroma agradável.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 5 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 5 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Grama, Monstro &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 88% M / 12% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 2/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Ivysaur pode evoluir para Venusaur no nível 11 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Growl, Leech Seed, Seed Bomb, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Vine Whip</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Poison Powder, Sleep Powder, Take Down</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Razor Leaf</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Sweet Scent</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Growth</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Double-Edge</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Worry Seed</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Synthesis</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Power Whip, Solar Beam</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acid Spray, Attract, Bind, Body Slam, Bullet Seed, Charm, Confide, Curse, Double Team, Double-Edge, Echoed Voice, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, False Swipe, Frustration, Giga Drain, Grass Knot, Grass Pledge, Grassy Glide, Grassy Terrain, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Knock Off, Leaf Storm, Light Screen, Magical Leaf, Nature Power, Protect, Rest, Return, Roar, Round, Safeguard, Seed Bomb, Sleep Talk, Sludge Bomb, Snore, Solar Beam, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swords Dance, Synthesis, Take Down, Tera Blast, Toxic, Trailblaze, Venoshock, Weather Ball, Work Up, Worry Seed</p>",
